%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Merchant / operator
    participant N as mp<br/>NextAuth v5
    participant S as Qorelly Supabase Auth
    participant A as apps/api<br/>SupabaseJwtGuard

    U->>N: GET /dashboard
    N->>N: proxy.ts: no session
    N-->>U: 302 /login?callbackUrl=/dashboard
    U->>N: POST /login (email, password) — server action
    N->>S: signInWithPassword(email, password)
    alt invalid credentials
        S-->>N: AuthError
        N-->>U: 302 /login?error=invalid
    else ok
        S-->>N: session {access_token, refresh_token, expires_at}
        N->>N: jwt callback stores tokens in encrypted NextAuth cookie
        N-->>U: 302 callbackUrl
    end

    Note over N: Every later request runs the jwt callback
    alt token expires within 60s
        N->>S: refreshSession(refresh_token)
        S-->>N: new access + refresh token
    end

    U->>N: action needing data
    N->>A: REST call, Authorization: Bearer access_token
    A->>A: verify (HS256 secret, or ES256/RS256 via JWKS)<br/>aud = authenticated, role ≠ anon/service_role
    A-->>N: 200 JSON (or 401)
    N-->>U: rendered page
